This product contains an experimental adapter boundary for Qwen3-VL-Embedding models published by the Qwen
team. Model weights, configuration, and associated code retain their own license and
attribution. MIRA Phase-1 training checkpoints record model and dataset license provenance.
Export manifests record the selected model revision and model license, but do not transfer
dataset rights.

MIRA does not copy MS-SWIFT source into its core package. A file derived from third-party
source must identify that source and its modifications in the file header.
